flowchart TB
    subgraph Client["Client Layer"]
        Browser["Browser<br/>(Next.js Frontend)"]
    end
    subgraph DockerHost["Docker Host (docker-compose)"]
        Nginx["Nginx<br/>Reverse Proxy<br/>:80"]
        Frontend["Frontend Container<br/>Next.js<br/>:3000"]
        Backend["Backend Container<br/>NestJS API<br/>:4000"]
        Redis["Redis Container<br/>Cache/Sessions<br/>:6379"]
        Postgres["PostgreSQL Container<br/>Database<br/>:5432"]
    end
    Browser -->|HTTP :80| Nginx
    Nginx -->|proxy /| Frontend
    Nginx -->|proxy /api| Backend
    Backend -->|Prisma ORM| Postgres
    Backend -->|cache/session ops| Redis
    Frontend -.->|SSR/API calls| Backend
    classDef container fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:1px
    classDef proxy fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#f9ab00,stroke-width:1px
    classDef db fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:1px
    class Frontend,Backend container
    class Nginx proxy
    class Postgres,Redis db
